# ============================================================================
# What must NOT be deployed.
#
# The deployed site is: index.html, styles.css, script.js, sfx-data.js,
# assets/, sfx/ and game/ — nothing else. Everything listed here is either
# authoring source, dev tooling, or documentation; shipping any of it would
# roughly double the payload for zero user benefit.
# ============================================================================

# The game's AUTHORING copy. game/ is the learner build that actually ships;
# "LBD 1/" is the full source with the God Mode design suite, the QA harness and
# the data scripts. ~11MB, none of it reachable from the site.
LBD 1/

# The mp4 video masters (see .gitignore). tools/convert-media.py turns these into
# assets/*.webm, which is what the site actually loads; the sources are ~54MB and
# unreachable from the page.
video-sources/

# The reusable EMPTY flipbook (no videos, no sfx) — a starting point to copy out
# for the next story, not part of this one. Nothing on the site links to it.
template/

# Dev tooling / docs that may sit alongside the game copy
game/god-mode/
game/qa/
game/scripts/
game/*.md
game/vercel.json

# Editor + OS cruft
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
Desktop.ini
*~
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# Source control + node
.git/
.gitignore
node_modules/
